{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Update channel" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新频道"}}}},
    "Stable" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正式版"}}}},
    "Preview" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览版"}}}},
    "Preview receives release candidates before they become the latest stable version." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览版会在候选版本成为最新正式版前收到更新。"}}}},
    "Installed language data is newer than this update channel. No downgrade will be downloaded." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的语言数据领先于此更新频道，不会下载旧版本。"}}}},
    "iCloud Drive sync" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iCloud Drive 同步"}}}},
    "Sync learned words with iCloud Drive" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"通过 iCloud Drive 同步学习词"}}}},
    "Location" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"位置"}}}},
    "iCloud Drive is unavailable. Check iCloud Drive in System Settings." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"iCloud Drive 当前不可用，请在系统设置中检查 iCloud Drive。"}}}},
    "Linnet always uses iCloud Drive/Linnet; no folder selection is required." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Linnet 固定使用 iCloud Drive/Linnet，无需选择文件夹。"}}}},
    "Rime incrementally merges learned Chinese and English words between your Macs. Linnet checks at most once per hour while it is running; the next activation catches up. It does not read or merge the user dictionary format itself." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Rime 会在多台 Mac 之间增量合并中英文学习词。Linnet 运行时每小时最多检查一次；下次启用输入法时会自动补上。Linnet 自身不会读取或合并用户词典格式。"}}}},
    "Recovery backups also include personal words, disabled words, and Text Expander data. The first upload creates a baseline; later uploads are incremental and manual." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复备份还包括个人词、停用词和文本扩展数据。首次上传建立基线；之后手动上传增量备份。"}}}},
    "The first upload creates a full recovery baseline. Later uploads add an immutable delta only. Local data is not changed." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"首次上传建立完整恢复基线，之后只添加不可变的增量数据。本地数据不会改变。"}}}},
    "Update language data, sync or move personal data, and review backups and diagnostics." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新语言数据、同步或迁移个人数据，并查看备份与诊断。"}}}},
    "Upload Recovery Backup" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上传恢复备份"}}}},
    "Sync Learning Now" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"立即同步学习词"}}}},
    "Upload Incremental Backup…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上传增量备份…"}}}},
    "Review Recovery Backup…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"审阅恢复备份…"}}}},
    "Upload an incremental recovery backup?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上传增量恢复备份？"}}}},
    "Repair cloud recovery backup?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"修复云端恢复备份？"}}}},
    "Create Full Repair Backup" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"创建完整修复备份"}}}},
    "The existing incremental recovery chain cannot be verified. This creates a new complete baseline; previous cloud objects are left unchanged." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"现有增量恢复链无法通过校验。此操作会创建新的完整基线，保留此前的云端文件。"}}}},
    "Repair language data with complete packs?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下载完整词包以修复语言数据？"}}}},
    "Download Complete Changed Packs" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下载有变化的完整词包"}}}},
    "The differential update could not finish. Installed data is unchanged. Retry later, or confirm a full download of changed packs. Unchanged packs and personal data are kept." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"差分更新未能完成，已安装的数据未改变。可稍后重试，或确认下载有变化的完整词包；不变词包和个人数据会保留。"}}}},
    "Checking detected legacy data…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在检查检测到的旧数据…"}}}},
    "Checking personal dictionary…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在检查个人词典…"}}}},
    "Compatible legacy data was verified." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已验证兼容的旧数据。"}}}},
    "Detected legacy data could not be verified." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法验证检测到的旧数据。"}}}},
    "Keep My Drafts" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留我的草稿"}}}},
    "Loading backups…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在载入备份…"}}}},
    "Settings data changed elsewhere" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置数据已在其他位置更改"}}}},
    "Reload Current Data" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新载入当前数据"}}}},
    "Your unsaved drafts were preserved. Reload the current settings data, or keep your drafts and review them before applying." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未保存的草稿已保留。请重新载入当前设置数据，或保留草稿并在应用前检查。"}}}},
    "deploy_failure" : {
