    "Data" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据"}}}},
    "Data & Updates" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据与更新"}}}},
    "Language data updates" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"语言数据更新"}}}},
    "Manual recovery & transfer" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"手动恢复与迁移"}}}},
    "Recovery history" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"恢复历史"}}}},
    "These recovery points are created before data-changing transactions; they are not automatic full backups." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"这些恢复点会在数据变更事务前创建；它们并不是自动完整备份。"}}}},
    "Full backup archives are created only when you choose a backup or export button." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有在你主动选择备份或导出按钮时，才会创建完整备份归档。"}}}},
    "Review updates, sync or move personal data, and manage recovery." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"查看更新、同步或迁移个人数据，并管理恢复选项。"}}}},
    "Core update" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"核心更新"}}}},
    "Advanced version details" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高级版本详情"}}}},
    "Source revision" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"源代码修订"}}}},
    "Switch away from Linnet before applying an installed Core update." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用已安装的核心更新前，请先切换到其他输入法。"}}}},
    "Switch away from Linnet before applying the installed Core update." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先切换到其他输入法，再应用已安装的核心更新。"}}}},
    "The installed Core update is being applied." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在应用已安装的核心更新。"}}}},
    "Installed Core will run after the next normal login or restart." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的核心将在下次正常登录或重启后运行。"}}}},
    "No installed Core update is waiting to be applied." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前没有等待应用的核心更新。"}}}},
    "Update language data, move personal data, and review backups and diagnostics." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新语言数据、迁移个人数据，并查看备份和诊断信息。"}}}},
    "Appearance" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"外观"}}}},
    "Choose a candidate-window theme and refine it before typing." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择并细调候选窗口主题。"}}}},
    "Theme, font, and appearance mode update here and in the next candidate window. Candidate count and layout require Apply Changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主题、字体与明暗模式会立即显示在这里，并同步到下一次出现的候选窗口；候选数与布局需点按“应用更改”。"}}}},
    "Candidate count is applied with the schema after you press Apply Changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每页候选数会在按下“应用更改”后随输入方案一起生效。"}}}},
    "Candidate appearance is live." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选窗口外观已实时生效。"}}}},
    "Appearance mode" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"明暗模式"}}}},
    "Candidates and IPA share the Latin face; Chinese candidates and definitions share the Chinese face. All presets use built-in macOS fonts." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选词与音标共用西文字体，中文候选与释义共用中文字体；所有预设均使用 macOS 原生字体。"}}}},
    "Clay" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"陶印"}}}},
    "Mist" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"雾青"}}}},
    "Glass" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原生玻璃"}}}},
    "Dark" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"深色"}}}},
    "Light" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"浅色"}}}},
