    "Moon" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"月华"}}}},
    "Ink" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"墨朱"}}}},
    "Slate" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"青岩"}}}},
    "System" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"跟随系统"}}}},
    "System Default" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"系统默认"}}}},
    "Selected automatically by macOS" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 macOS 自动选择"}}}},
    "System follows the active text window when macOS exposes its appearance; otherwise it follows the macOS appearance." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 提供外观信息时会跟随当前输入窗口；否则跟随 macOS 外观。"}}}},
    "The local candidate preview is unavailable because its bundled theme data could not be read." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本地候选预览不可用，因为内置主题数据无法读取。"}}}},
    "The preview and candidate window use this theme. Settings keeps the native macOS appearance." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览与候选窗口使用此主题；设置窗口保持 macOS 原生外观。"}}}},
    "Theme" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主题风格"}}}},
    "Each theme includes paired Light and Dark appearances." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每套主题均包含相配的浅色与深色外观。"}}}},
    "Choose this candidate-window theme." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择这套候选窗口主题。"}}}},
    "Selected" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已选择"}}}},
    "Not selected" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未选择"}}}},
    "Typeface" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中英文字体"}}}},
    "Apply Changes" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用更改"}}}},
    "Apply your changes before closing?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭前要应用更改吗？"}}}},
    "Discard Changes" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"丢弃更改"}}}},
    "Keep Editing" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续编辑"}}}},
    "Input, English, candidate layout, and personal-data changes are not active until you apply them." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入、英文、候选布局和个人数据更改只有在应用后才会生效。"}}}},
    "Theme, font, and appearance mode save and apply to the candidate window live. Candidate count, candidate layouts, Input, English, and personal data require Apply Changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"主题、字体和明暗模式会实时保存并应用到候选窗口；候选数、候选布局、输入、英文和个人数据需点按“应用更改”。"}}}},
    "Application" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用程序"}}}},
    "Automatic backups" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动备份"}}}},
    "Cancel" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取消"}}}},
    "Cancel Download" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取消下载"}}}},
    "Candidate" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选项"}}}},
    "n. 接口" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"n. 接口"}}}},
    "/ˈɪntəfeɪs/" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"/ˈɪntəfeɪs/"}}}},
    "Candidate font size" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选字体大小"}}}},
    "12–32 pt. The local visual preview updates immediately; the live candidate window follows the appearance setting." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"12–32 磅。本地视觉预览会立即更新；真实候选窗口会跟随外观设置。"}}}},
    "Candidate window" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选窗口"}}}},
    "Input mode" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入模式"}}}},
    "Input changes are pending. Choose Apply Changes before testing them." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入更改尚待应用；请先点按“应用更改”再测试。"}}}},
    "Example" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"示例"}}}},
    "The example follows the selected Chinese scheme and trigger key." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"示例会随所选中文方案与触发键变化。"}}}},
    "Candidates per page" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每页候选数"}}}},
    "Candidate browsing" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"候选浏览"}}}},
    "Scrolling only" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅滚动"}}}},
    "Expandable" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可展开"}}}},
    "Capitalize sentence starts" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"句首自动大写"}}}},
    "Chinese and English…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文和英文…"}}}},
    "Chinese candidates" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文候选"}}}},
    "Chinese and English keep independent horizontal or vertical layouts. Expandable browsing starts compact, then pressing [ or ] (or - or =) to switch candidate pages expands up to three pages automatically. Every new composition starts collapsed. These changes take effect after Apply Changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文和英文分别保存横排或竖排方向；“可展开”会先显示紧凑候选，随后按 [、]、- 或 = 切换候选页时自动展开最多三页。每次重新组词仍从收起状态开始。这些更改会在点按“应用更改”后生效。"}}}},
    "Chinese options" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文选项"}}}},
    "Chinese…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文…"}}}},
    "Clear Learning" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"清除学习数据"}}}},
    "Commit current candidate" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"上屏当前候选"}}}},
    "Data management" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据管理"}}}},
    "Download source" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下载来源"}}}},
    "GitHub (Direct)" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GitHub（直连）"}}}},
    "GH-Proxy Public Mirror (Third-party)" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GH-Proxy 公共镜像（第三方）"}}}},
    "Custom Mirror…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自定义镜像…"}}}},
    "Custom mirror base URL" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自定义镜像根地址"}}}},
    "Enter the HTTPS root address provided by a GHProxy-compatible service." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请输入兼容 GHProxy 的服务提供的 HTTPS 根地址。"}}}},
    "Use Custom Mirror" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用自定义镜像"}}}},
    "Enter a compatible HTTPS mirror root address." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请输入兼容的 HTTPS 镜像根地址。"}}}},
    "Use Custom Mirror to make this address active before downloading." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下载前，请点按“使用自定义镜像”以启用该地址。"}}}},
    "GH-Proxy is an independent third-party service and is not operated by Linnet or GitHub." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GH-Proxy 是独立的第三方服务，不由 Linnet 或 GitHub 运营。"}}}},
    "Mirrors are third-party services that can see your IP address, request time, and requested public file URLs. Linnet never sends them your dictionaries, learning data, credentials, or other personal data." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"镜像是第三方服务，可以看到你的 IP 地址、请求时间和所请求的公开文件地址。Linnet 不会向其发送你的词典、学习数据、凭据或其他个人数据。"}}}},
    "Open GH-Proxy Service Information" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开 GH-Proxy 服务说明"}}}},
    "This built-in mirror is unavailable. Choose another source before updating." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此内置镜像已不可用。更新前请选择其他下载来源。"}}}},
    "GitHub Direct is the default. Choose a mirror only when direct downloads are unreliable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"默认使用 GitHub 直连。仅在直连下载不稳定时选择镜像。"}}}},
    "The selected source is used only for future language-data downloads. Linnet never switches or falls back to another source automatically." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选来源仅用于之后的语言数据下载；Linnet 不会自动切换或回退到其他来源。"}}}},
    "Linnet verifies every downloaded release pack before activation." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Linnet 会在启用前验证每个下载的发布包。"}}}},
    "Choose and save a valid download source before checking for updates." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查更新前，请选择并保存有效的下载来源。"}}}},
    "Data services are unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据服务当前不可用。"}}}},
    "Diagnostics" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"诊断"}}}},
    "Dictionary" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"词典"}}}},
    "Keep personal words, exclusions, and text expansions in one place." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"集中管理个人词语、停用词和文本扩展。"}}}},
    "Disabled English words" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停用的英文词"}}}},
