    "Type the selected key before the chosen scheme's code in Chinese mode." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在中文模式下，请先输入所选触发键，再输入当前方案的编码。"}}}},
    "Smart English recognizes the selected full- or double-pinyin scheme automatically; semicolon and other punctuation go directly to the current app." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"智能英文会自动识别所选的全拼或双拼方案；分号及其他标点会直接输入当前应用。"}}}},
