    "The verified backup replaces current data. The current state is backed up first." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已验证备份将替换当前数据；当前状态会先自动备份。"}}}},
    "A language-data update is available below. No logout is required." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下方有可用的语言数据更新，无需注销。"}}}},
