    "Installed Core update is ready" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的核心更新已就绪"}}}},
    "Installed Core revision differs from the running Core" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装核心的内部版本与当前运行核心不同"}}}},
    "The version and build are the same, but the installed source revision differs. You can keep using the running Core or apply the installed revision after switching away from Linnet." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本号和构建号相同，但已安装核心的源码版本不同。你可以继续使用当前核心，也可以先切换到其他输入法，再应用已安装的版本。"}}}},
    "You can keep using the current Core, or apply the installed Core after switching away from Linnet. Other apps stay open and no logout is required." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你可以继续使用当前核心，也可以先切换到其他输入法，再应用已安装的核心。其他应用会保持打开，无需注销。"}}}},
    "Running" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在运行"}}}},
    "Installed" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装"}}}},
    "Apply Installed Update…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用已安装的更新…"}}}},
    "Applying installed Core…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在应用已安装的核心…"}}}},
    "Keep another input source selected until Settings closes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在设置窗口关闭前，请保持选中其他输入法。"}}}},
    "The installed Core is waiting" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的核心正在等待"}}}},
    "Try Apply Again…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"再次尝试应用…"}}}},
    "Installed Core is now running" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的新核心现已运行"}}}},
    "Settings will close so its own connection can reopen cleanly." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置将关闭，以便其自身连接随后能够干净地重建。"}}}},
    "This running Core cannot apply the update safely" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前运行的核心无法安全应用更新"}}}},
    "Keep using the current Core. After the next normal macOS login or restart, future Core updates can use Apply Now without another logout." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请继续使用当前核心。下次正常登录 macOS 或重启后，未来的核心更新即可使用“立即应用”，无需再次注销。"}}}},
    "The installed Core was not activated" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装的核心未能启用"}}}},
    "Core activation could not be verified. Check the runtime before trying again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未确认核心更新已生效。请检查运行状态后再试。"}}}},
    "The selected input source could not be read. Select another input source in the macOS input menu, then try again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法读取当前输入源。请在 macOS 输入菜单中切换到其他输入法后重试，无需注销。"}}}},
    "Use the macOS input menu to select another input source, then try again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请通过 macOS 输入法菜单选择其他输入法，然后重试。"}}}},
    "Finish or cancel the current composition, then try again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先完成或取消当前输入，再重试。"}}}},
    "Wait for the current data operation to finish, then try again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请等待当前数据操作完成，然后重试。"}}}},
    "An unidentified app used this Host, so Linnet cannot prove that an immediate restart is safe. The update will remain installed for the next login or restart." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"有无法识别的应用使用过此 Host，因此 Linnet 无法证明立即重启是安全的。更新将保持已安装状态，并在下次登录或重启时生效。"}}}},
    "Settings could not establish the one safe activation requester. Reopen Settings and try again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置无法建立唯一的安全激活请求方。请重新打开设置后再试。"}}}},
    "Apply the installed Core now?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"现在应用已安装的核心？"}}}},
    "First use the macOS input menu to select another input source." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先使用 macOS 输入菜单切换到其他输入法。"}}}},
    "Your apps stay open. Settings closes after the new Core is verified." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其他应用会保持打开；新核心验证成功后，设置将关闭。"}}}},
    "Apply Now" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"立即应用"}}}},
    "Check Runtime Again" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新检查运行状态"}}}},
    "Running Core identity is unavailable." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法获取正在运行核心的身份。"}}}},
    "Run the Complete installer to repair Linnet before checking for updates." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先运行完整安装包修复 Linnet，再检查更新。"}}}},
    "Updates do not stop the current Core or its app connections. The installed Core will run after the next macOS login or restart." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新不会停止当前核心或中断应用连接；已安装的新核心将在下次登录 macOS 或重启后运行。"}}}},
