    "Open Legacy Installer…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开旧版安装器…"}}}},
    "Apply Update…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用更新…"}}}},
    "Settings is downloading the update and will verify its exact bytes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置正在下载更新并校验精确字节。"}}}},
    "This transitional update still uses macOS Installer. Open it only if you need to update from an older Core." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"此过渡版本仍使用 macOS 安装器；只有从旧核心升级时才需打开它。"}}}},
    "Switch to another input source, then apply the verified update here. Apps stay open; no Installer, password, logout, or restart is required." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切换到其他输入法后，即可在这里应用已校验的更新。其他应用保持打开，不需要安装器、密码、注销或重启。"}}}},
    "Keep another input source selected while Settings starts and verifies the new Core." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"设置启动并验证新核心时，请保持选中其他输入法。"}}}},
    "The new Core is running. Settings will close and reopen cleanly the next time you choose it." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"新核心已经运行。设置将关闭，下次打开时会建立新的连接。"}}}},
    "The update could not be verified or rolled back automatically. Run Linnet.pkg once to repair the installation." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新无法完成验证或自动回滚。请运行一次 Linnet.pkg 修复安装。"}}}},
    "The update was not downloaded, extracted, or verified. The installed Core was not changed." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新未能下载、解压或通过校验；已安装的核心没有改变。"}}}},
    "Download and verify the Core update here. Applying it does not use Installer and does not require a password or logout." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可在这里下载并校验核心更新；应用更新不使用安装器，也不需要密码或注销。"}}}},
    "Apply the downloaded Core update now?" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"现在应用已下载的核心更新？"}}}},
    "Your apps stay open. No Installer, password, logout, or restart is required." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"其他应用保持打开，不需要安装器、密码、注销或重启。"}}}},
    "Linnet and language data are up to date." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Linnet 与语言数据均为最新版本。"}}}},
    "Update check failed. Try again when you are online." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查更新失败，请联网后重试。"}}}},
    "Update status is not available yet." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法获取更新状态。"}}}},
    "Update status is unavailable until the installation is repaired." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"修复安装后才能检查更新状态。"}}}},
    "Update Language Data" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新语言数据"}}}},
    "Reinstall Linnet to restore the required local language data." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请重新安装 Linnet，以恢复必需的本地语言数据。"}}}},
    "Update language data without reinstalling Linnet." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无需重新安装 Linnet 即可更新语言数据。"}}}},
    "Updates are built by Linnet from pinned upstream projects. Settings downloads only Linnet release packs, never raw upstream dictionaries or models." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更新数据由 Linnet 基于锁定的上游项目构建；设置应用只下载 Linnet 发布包，不会直接下载上游原始词典或模型。"}}}},
    "Repair the installation before managing language data." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先修复安装，再管理语言数据。"}}}},
    "Value" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内容"}}}},
    "Better prediction for long Chinese sentences." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提升中文长句预测效果。"}}}},
    "Detecting grammar model…" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在检测语法模型…"}}}},
    "Wanxiang LTS grammar data (about 420 MB) — Active" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"万象 LTS 语法数据（约 420 MB）— 已启用"}}}},
    "The Wanxiang LTS grammar model (420 MB) is part of every recommended Linnet installation and improves long-sentence prediction. It is an input-method n-gram model, not a generative large language model. Data updates are fully verified before atomic activation." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"万象 LTS 语法模型（420 MB）包含在每个推荐版 Linnet 中，用于改善长句预测。它是输入法 n-gram 模型，不是生成式大语言模型。数据更新会经过完整校验后再原子激活。"}}}},
    "Case-insensitive exact words" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不区分大小写的精确词语"}}}},
    "Explicit triggers begin with x;" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显式触发码以 x; 开头"}}}},
    "Value and lowercase Rime code" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内容与小写 Rime 编码"}}}},
    "code" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"编码"}}}},
    "word" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"词语"}}}},
    "x;trigger" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"x;触发码"}}}},
    "Changes pending — use Apply Changes to activate this strategy." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"更改待应用，请点按“应用更改”启用此策略。"}}}},
    "Chinese learning strategy" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文学习策略"}}}},
    "Changing this setting never deletes learning data. Use Clear Learning in Data to remove it." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"切换策略不会删除学习数据。如需删除，请在“数据”中使用“清除学习数据”。"}}}},
    "Enhanced learning (Recommended)" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"增强学习（推荐）"}}}},
    "Uses Rime's native learning and adds Linnet's extra phrase reinforcement for unfamiliar character-by-character compositions." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保留 Rime 原生学习，并启用 Linnet 的额外短语强化，帮助记住逐字组成的词库外新短语。"}}}},
    "Learning strategy" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"学习策略"}}}},
    "Standard learning" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"标准学习"}}}},
    "Stops reading and updating Chinese learning data. Existing data returns when learning is enabled again." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"停止读取和更新中文学习数据；重新开启学习后，已有数据会恢复。"}}}},
    "Takes effect after Apply Changes. Switching strategies never deletes learning data." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按下“应用更改”后生效；切换策略不会删除学习数据。"}}}},
    "Turn off learning" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭学习"}}}},
    "Uses only Rime's native learning. It still remembers selected candidates and may learn short phrases assembled from segments." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅使用 Rime 原生学习；仍会记住已选候选，也可能学习由分段选择组成的短语。"}}}},
    "IPA, Chinese definitions, and context suggestions can be hidden. English correction and fuzzy matching are always available. Changes take effect after Apply Changes." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"IPA、中文释义和上下文联想可分别隐藏；英文模式始终支持拼写纠错与模糊匹配。设置在点按“应用更改”后生效。"}}}},
    "Turning off learning stops reading and updating English learning data. Existing data returns when learning is enabled again; static context suggestions and spacing remain available." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭学习后将停止读取和更新英文学习数据；重新开启时已有数据会恢复，静态上下文联想与空格处理仍然可用。"}}}},
    "Version" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本"}}}},
    "Vertical" : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"竖排"}}}},
    "Settings..." : {
      "comment" : "Menu item",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}
